  "project_description": "AI Search Block Extras is an opt-in UX add-on for AI Search Block. It provides an admin settings screen with feature toggles; the shipped feature is an auto-grow textarea that expands one row at a time as the visitor types, so the scrollbar never appears. When enabled, a form_alter attaches the auto-grow library only to AI Search form blocks that use the textarea input type. Depends on AI Search Block.",
